# Codebase Structure - Vitae ESG Assessment Platform

## Project Overview

This is a comprehensive ESG (Environmental, Social, Governance) assessment platform built with React Router v7. The project follows Epic Stack conventions and includes a sophisticated assessment system with real-time persistence, three-column accordion help system, and advanced markdown processing capabilities.

## Main Structure

- Single application structure (not a monorepo)
- Uses React Router v7 with Express server
- Built with Vite as the build tool
- SQLite database with Prisma ORM
- Deployed on Fly.io with LiteFS for database replication
- **Core Feature**: ESG Assessment system with SurveyJS integration (88 questions across 7 sections)
- **Latest Enhancement (v2.0)**: Three-column accordion help system with markdown support and field name display

